---
import Logo from "../assets/Logo Vega Escayolas.png";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Página no encontrada | Vega Escayolas</title>
        <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
        <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png" />
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png" />
        <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            body {
                font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
                    Roboto, sans-serif;
                background-color: #f9fafd;
                color: #1f283a;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                min-height: 100vh;
                padding: 2rem;
                text-align: center;
            }
            img {
                max-width: 200px;
                height: auto;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 3rem;
                color: #1f283a;
                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            }
            p {
                color: #666;
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                line-height: 1.6;
                max-width: 30rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            .volver {
                display: inline-block;
                background-color: #8bc34a;
                color: #1F283A;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
                border-radius: 25px;
                font-weight: bold;
                transition: transform 0.25s ease-out;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            .volver:hover {
                transform: scale(1.06);
            }
            .redes {
                display: flex;
                gap: 1rem;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .redes a {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 0.5rem;
                text-decoration: none;
                color: #1f283a;
                font-weight: bold;
                padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
                border: 3px solid #eef2f7;
                border-radius: 25px;
                transition:
                    transform 0.25s ease-out,
                    border-color 0.25s ease-out;
            }
            .redes a:hover {
                transform: scale(1.06);
                border-color: #8bc34a;
            }
            .redes svg {
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <img
            src={Logo.src}
            alt="Logo de Vega Escayolas, expertos en escayola, pladur y perlita"
            width="200"
            height="56"
        />
        <h1>404</h1>
        <p>
            Vaya, la página que buscas no existe. Puede que la dirección no sea
            correcta o que el contenido ya no esté disponible.
        </p>
        <a class="volver" href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
        <div class="redes">
            <a
                href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61555620961917"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
            >
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="#8BC34A"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                >
                    <path
                        d="M22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10S2 6.477 2 12c0 5.013 3.693 9.153 8.5 9.877v-6.99H7.875V12h2.625V9.794c0-2.587 1.54-4.017 3.895-4.017 1.13 0 2.312.202 2.312.202v2.535h-1.302c-1.283 0-1.683.796-1.683 1.613V12h2.864l-.458 2.887h-2.406v6.99C18.307 21.153 22 17.013 22 12z"
                    />
                </svg>
                Facebook
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:vegaescayolas@gmail.com">
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="#8BC34A"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                >
                    <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
                    <path
                        d="M22 7.535v9.465a3 3 0 0 1 -2.824 2.995l-.176 .005h-14a3 3 0 0 1 -2.995 -2.824l-.005 -.176v-9.465l9.445 6.297l.116 .066a1 1 0 0 0 .878 0l.116 -.066l9.445 -6.297z"
                    />
                    <path
                        d="M19 4c1.08 0 2.027 .57 2.555 1.427l-9.555 6.37l-9.555 -6.37a2.999 2.999 0 0 1 2.354 -1.42l.201 -.007h14z"
                    />
                </svg>
                Email
            </a>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
